{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H38310","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"Motion to reconsider laid on the table Agreed to without objection.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H37100","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 219 - 210 (Roll no. 201). (text of amendment in the nature of a substitute: CR H3427-3428)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"8000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Passed/agreed to in House: On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 219 - 210 (Roll no. 201).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H3450)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 1919, the Chair put the question on passage of the bill and by voice vote, announced that the ayes had prevailed. Ms. Waters demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 1919.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4016, H.R. 3633, H.R. 1919 and S. 1582. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4016 and H.R. 3633 under a structured rule, and H.R. 1919 and S. 1582 under a closed rule, with one hour of general debate on each bill. The resolution provides for a motion to recommit on H.R. 4016, H.R. 3633, and H.R. 1919, and a motion to commit on S. 1582.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-07-17","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 580. (consideration: CR H3427-3434)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H1L210","actionDate":"2025-07-15","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 580 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4016, H.R. 3633, H.R. 1919 and S. 1582. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4016 and H.R. 3633 under a structured rule, and H.R. 1919 and S. 1582 under a closed rule, with one hour of general debate on each bill. The resolution provides for a motion to recommit on H.R. 4016, H.R. 3633, and H.R. 1919, and a motion to commit on S. 1582.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H12410","actionDate":"2025-05-06","source":"House floor actions","text":"Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 66.","type":"Calendars"},{"actionCode":"H12200","actionDate":"2025-05-06","source":"House floor actions","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Financial Services. H. Rept. 119-92.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"5000","actionDate":"2025-05-06","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Financial Services. H. Rept. 119-92.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"H19000","actionDate":"2025-04-02","source":"House committee actions","text":"Ordered to be Reported (Amended) by the Yeas and Nays: 27 - 22.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"H15001","actionDate":"2025-04-02","source":"House committee actions","text":"Committee Consideration and Mark-up Session Held","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"H11100","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Financial Services.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"Intro-H","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"1000","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Int